# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Without this, git converts text files on checkout and the same commit is CRLF
# on Windows and LF on Linux. Any integrity check over file bytes then reports
# a mismatch across platforms that is not a real change. Subject hashes are
# additionally computed over LF-normalised content, so the check is correct
# even on a checkout that predates this file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary and generated files must never be converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gguf binary
